# What `sky launch` / `remote/hpc.sh push` do NOT upload. Data is generated on
# the GPU box; checkpoints and runs come back down with rsync afterwards.
#
# Top-level directories are anchored with a leading slash on purpose: an
# unanchored `data/` would also match `ocr/data/`, which is source code.
/.git/
/data/
/outputs/
/checkpoints/
/runs/
/.venv/
/venv/
/myenv/
/remote/hpc.env
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store
